# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The vault itself - the USER'S mind
# The vault is personal knowledge, chat history, directives, and notes.
# A baseline vault ships empty; each user grows their own.
# These hierarchical folders (now under vaultbot_stuff/) are where VaultBot writes its output:
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────



# Hierarchical-layout personal vault content (post-reorg)
# These are the USER'S mind: chat logs, personal knowledge, personal notes.
# vaultbot_stuff/System/ ships framework defaults (filtered below) but the rest is personal.
vaultbot_stuff/Memory/
vaultbot_stuff/Knowledge/
User/

# Personal files inside the shippable System/ framework tree
vaultbot_stuff/System/Identity/Sean-Communication-Preferences.md
vaultbot_stuff/System/Identity/Auto-Resume-Directive.md
vaultbot_stuff/System/Identity/Autonomy-Directive.md
vaultbot_stuff/System/Identity/IDK-Fallback-Directive.md
vaultbot_stuff/System/Identity/No-Wikipedia-Directive.md
vaultbot_stuff/System/Identity/Vault-Knowledge-Only-Directive.md
vaultbot_stuff/System/Identity/Fractal-Entropy-Principle.md
vaultbot_stuff/System/Identity/Self-Edit-Verification-Directive.md
vaultbot_stuff/System/Patterns/Cross-Session-Patterns-*.md
vaultbot_stuff/System/Quality-Gates/Calibration-via-Operator-Feedback.md
vaultbot_stuff/System/Architecture/Small-Model-Path-to-AGI.md
vaultbot_stuff/System/Architecture/Vault-Longevity-Architecture.md

# Personal root directives + notes (operator relationship with their bot)
2026-*.md
*-Directive.md
*-Communication-Preferences.md
*-Principle.md
